sequenceDiagram
 actor User
 participant View as GUI / CLI
 participant Controller as Controller + ReportCommand
 participant Agent as Facade + AgentWorkflow
 participant Tools as ToolManager
 participant LLM as LLMClient
 participant Export as ReportExporter
 User->>View: Report name, optional category/dates
 View->>Controller: execute(command)
 Controller->>Agent: generateReport(request)
 Agent->>Agent: resolve category and construct fixed plan
 Agent->>Tools: HISTORY
 Tools-->>Agent: dated observations and sources
 Agent->>Tools: ANALYZE
 Tools-->>Agent: deterministic metrics and lifecycle
 Agent->>Tools: DISCOVER in same category/range
 Tools-->>Agent: ranked category evidence
 Agent->>LLM: synthesize EvidenceBundle
 alt API succeeds
  LLM-->>Agent: narrative and token usage
 else unavailable
  LLM-->>Agent: error
  Agent->>Agent: retain evidence and add warning
 end
 Agent-->>View: AgentResponse with TrendReport
 View-->>User: evidence, narrative or fallback
 opt Save report in GUI
  User->>View: select a new destination
  View->>Export: write(response, path) in background
  Export-->>View: created file or existing-file error
 end
